WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Import, edit, listen and practise.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Import MusicXML. PDFs and photos need recognition and review.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Change the selected note’s pitch and save.

4
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Transpose up two semitones and save a new version.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
See the same score in numbered notation.

6
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Play the current score at 80 BPM.

7
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Export MusicXML, MIDI and WAV audio.

8
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Loop a passage at 80 BPM.

9
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Assign measures 1–4 and add practice instructions.

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Audio transcription is not part of this demo.

11
00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Bring your music to ScoreTransposer.
